Third-party material in site/

Theme palettes (src/config/themes.ts)
  Colour values of the tokyo-night, gruvbox, everforest, catppuccin, rose-pine
  and flexoki-light Omarchy themes, copied from themes/<name>/colors.toml in
  https://github.com/basecamp/omarchy
  Copyright (c) David Heinemeier Hansson, MIT License.
  The original theme names belong to their respective palette authors.

pohunek design tokens (src/styles/tokens.css, DESIGN.md)
  Colours and type roles of the "Engraver & Phosphor" system of pohunek.dev
  (https://pohunek.dev), the same project and owner as this repository.

Engravings (src/assets/engravings/)
  Brand artwork of the pohunek project, taken from the pohunek.dev site, resized
  and re-encoded as WebP.

Fonts (installed from Fontsource, self-hosted, SIL Open Font License 1.1)
  JetBrains Mono, Domine, Karla.

Omarchy and Basecamp logos and wordmark fonts are not used. This site is not
affiliated with Omarchy or Basecamp.
